@Paul Turner

I don't think so.  I don't know the number of letters in ANY word I know how to spell, including my own name.  (Well, I guess "B" is easy.)

The puzzle has trained me to get a feel for word lengths, but I still couldn't give you counts.

@Larry R 
Looks like they wanted a rebus here. If it's 2, they will also accept TWO, which means they will also accept just the first letter, T. 

Didn't realize the Midi had rebuses.

@JMF

You are exactly right--the comments can put a torque on how we feel about ourselves and the puzzle.

It's like playing the guitar or the piano, or learning to ski, or bowling...the key is to find a way to compete with oneself, and do as little comparison with others as possible.  No matter what one does, there's always someone who can do it better.  So we have to try to make that "not the point'.

