@Jairus

I am more of a tool snob, but I can say that this crossword puzzle was very easy for me for a saturday. It took me 17 minutes and 34 seconds, so you can see, i'm not some kind of whiz kid. The wizards here probably did it in six minutes.

Easy and hard as relative to the solver. I don't see a judgment or a put down of anybody when a person says a puzzle was easy. It is a judgment of the puzzle relative to the commenter's ability and their desire for something that is either easier or harder than what they got that day.
